    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-63" id="fn-63" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Represents gas injected into company owned storage.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-64" id="fn-64" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Item 5:</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="padding-left:9pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">There are no bundled sales and transportation volumes included on page 520.</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="padding-left:9pt">
        <span>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Item 9:</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="padding-left:13.5pt;text-indent:-9pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">1)</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:0.11pt">None of the system supply gas that is stored is reported as sales, transportation or compression volumes.</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="padding-left:13.5pt;text-indent:-9pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">2)</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:0.11pt">There is no intent to sell or transport system supply volumes that are stored.</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="padding-left:13.5pt;text-indent:-9pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">3)</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:0.11pt">The contract storage volumes at the end of the period were 37,643,607 Dth.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-65" id="fn-65" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Volumes are allocated between Discounted, Negotiated and Recourse rate based upon the throughput delivered rate type excluding volumes delivered on the North Badlands and Round Prairie sub-systems.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-66" id="fn-66" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Volumes are allocated between Discounted, Negotiated and Recourse rate based upon the throughput delivered rate type excluding volumes delivered on the North Badlands and Round Prairie sub-systems.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-67" id="fn-67" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Volumes are allocated between Discounted, Negotiated and Recourse rate based upon the throughput delivered rate type excluding volumes delivered on the North Badlands and Round Prairie sub-systems.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-68" id="fn-68" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Shipper Supplied Gas is not directly charged to an account. As directed under FERC Order No. 581, any excess or deficiency in net Shipper Supplied Gas is recorded as "Other Regulatory Assets/Liabilities" (Accounts 182.3/254) with offsetting entries booked to "Regulatory Debits/Credits" (Accounts 407.3/407.4).</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-69" id="fn-69" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Gas Used for Compressor Station Fuel is valued based upon CIG Index as published in Gas Daily.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-70" id="fn-70" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Gas Used for Other Deliveries and Operations is valued based upon CIG Index as published in Gas Daily.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-71" id="fn-71" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Gas Lost and Unaccounted For is valued based upon CIG Index as published in Gas Daily.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-72" id="fn-72" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Net Excess or (Deficiency) balances are refunded or collected in-kind through WBI Energy Transmission's annual Fuel and Electric Power Reimbursement Adjustment Provision pursuant to Section 35 of the General Terms and Conditions of the Tariff.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-73" id="fn-73" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Federal income tax adjustments include FIN 48 interest.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-74" id="fn-74" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">State income tax adjustments include closing/filing penalties and interest.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-75" id="fn-75" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Montana property tax adjustments include taxes on lease property.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-76" id="fn-76" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Other Unemployment Taxes include miscellaneous amounts charged to various construction, clearing, or expense accounts based upon a payroll loading factor.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-77" id="fn-77" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Other Sales and Use Taxes include amounts charged directly to various expense, inventory, and construction accounts.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-78" id="fn-78" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Other Property Taxes include amounts directly charged to overhead clearing accounts.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-79" id="fn-79" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Other Federal Insurance Taxes include miscellaneous amounts charged to various construction, clearing, or expense accounts based upon a payroll loading factor.</link:footnote>
